From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 04:29:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] cli: support explicitly selected tsrs typechecking

Accept tsrs in project configuration and the typecheck command. Invoke its native-executable launcher through Node, parse the TypeScript SemVer token from its extended banner, and preserve watched files and diagnostic retry invalidation.

Keep tsc as the default, retain existing missing-compiler modes, and leave the SDK declaration baseline unchanged. This client build-tool option requires no backend protocol upgrade.
