 ## Maintained changes
 
+### Configurable tsrs typechecking
+
+Projects with the `tsrs` package installed can select
+`"typescriptCompiler": "tsrs"` in `convex.json` for deployment, development and
+code-generation typechecks. `convex typecheck --typescript-compiler tsrs`
+overrides the project setting for one check. The CLI invokes the package's
+JavaScript launcher, retains watched-file registration and diagnostic retries,
+and reports a missing selected compiler without silently substituting another
+compiler. Existing `tsc` and `tsgo` selection and typecheck enable/try/disable
+semantics are unchanged. tsrs uses TypeScript 7.1 development semantics and
+supports Linux x64/arm64 and macOS arm64 in version 0.18. The SDK itself retains
+its existing tsc declaration build and TypeScript baseline.
+
 ### Live runtime selection
 
